Fix another batch of small correctness bugs: `Qobj.sqrtm` now actually uses its `sparse`/`tol`/`maxiter` arguments instead of silently dropping them, `StochasticSolver.run_from_experiment` no longer leaks a modified `dt` into the integrator options on the successful path, `set_direct_component` gained the `dtype` keyword argument its own type stubs advertise, and `qutip.core.dimensions.einsum` derives its result `dims` from the einsum subscripts instead of naively bisecting the output shape (which was wrong for non-square operands).
